================================================================================
PROJECT CONTEXT
ENGINEERING COMPANY IT LAB
================================================================================

VERSION

    Architecture Baseline: v1.4
    Status: APPROVED
    Purpose: Master context for the entire project


================================================================================
PROJECT PURPOSE
================================================================================

Build a realistic IT infrastructure laboratory representing
a small international engineering company.

The lab is a HANDS-ON INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECT.

Primary goal:

    DESIGN
        ↓
    IMPLEMENT
        ↓
    VERIFY
        ↓
    TROUBLESHOOT
        ↓
    DOCUMENT
        ↓
    REVIEW
        ↓
    PROCEED


The project is intended to provide practical experience with:


    IT Administration
    Virtualization
    Networking
    Cloud
    Windows / Active Directory
    IT Operations
    Automation
    Infrastructure as Code
    ITSM
    Monitoring
    Security
    Troubleshooting
    Documentation


The goal is NOT to reproduce an enterprise environment perfectly.

The goal is to build a coherent, realistic and maintainable
engineering-company environment where infrastructure components
actually interact with each other.



================================================================================
