PHASE 1 TROUBLESHOOTING
================================================================================

Troubleshooting remains part of implementation.

Completed troubleshooting cases from the lab foundation:


    [x] TRB-001
    [x] TRB-002
    [x] TRB-003


TRB-003:


    Windows machines could reach the gateway and MINT01,
    but DC01 and WIN01 could not ping each other.


Root cause:


    Windows Firewall did not allow ICMP echo requests
    on the active network profile.


Resolution:


    ICMP echo was explicitly allowed on both machines.


Verification:


    [x] DC01 -> WIN01
    [x] WIN01 -> DC01


Troubleshooting documentation:


    docs/incidents/troubleshooting/


No new networking incident documentation was required
during the Phase 1 review.


