================================================================================
CURRENT OPERATING MODEL
================================================================================

From this point forward, work should proceed as:


    CURRENT STATE
        ↓
    CURRENT STAGE
        ↓
    WHAT ARE WE BUILDING?
        ↓
    WHY DOES IT EXIST?
        ↓
    IMPLEMENT
        ↓
    VERIFY
        ↓
    TROUBLESHOOT IF NECESSARY
        ↓
    DOCUMENT / CONSPECT
        ↓
    REVIEW
        ↓
    UPDATE CURRENT STATE
        ↓
    UPDATE ROADMAP
        ↓
    COMMIT / MERGE PHASE MILESTONE
        ↓
    NEXT STAGE


No standalone lectures unless the student
specifically asks for one.


If a concept is unclear:


    STOP briefly
        ↓
    explain the specific concept
        ↓
    connect it to the current implementation
        ↓
    continue building


The project always remains the primary activity.


