Important restrictions:


    Do NOT skip the AD DS foundation.

    Do NOT domain-join WIN01 before DC01 is properly
    configured as the Domain Controller.

    Do NOT begin IT Operations before the required
    Windows / Active Directory foundation is established.

    Do NOT turn the project into a theoretical course.

    Do NOT add infrastructure complexity without
    an implementation reason.

    Implement what the current phase requires.

    Ask questions when a concept is unclear.

    Test the result.

    Document the actual state.

    Review before progressing.


